    {
      "data": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "High-Performance Open-Source Statistical Package in 100% Pure Safe Rust"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1793974413995825400",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**ArtCraft (`storytold`) Ecosystem Canon | Dual-licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0**"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793974413995826400",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793974413995827100",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "1. Mission and Architectural Canon"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1793974413995827700",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**StatCraft** is built as an uncompromising, high-performance, crash-proof, and fully open alternative to IBM SPSS Statistics."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793974413995828600",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "* **100% Safe Rust & Never Crash:** Zero `unsafe`, zero `panic!`, zero `unwrap()`. Malformed input, empty arrays, or division by zero will never crash the application.\n* **Commands, Not Handlers:** Every user action and analytical procedure is an engine command (`EngineCommand`) supporting Undo/Redo, serialization into classic SPSS syntax (`.sps`), and automation by AI agents.\n* **Agent-First Architecture:** Built-in Model Context Protocol (MCP) and local IPC socket for native external AI orchestrator control and automated natural language interpretations in Output Viewer.\n* **Zero-Hardcode i18n:** 100% UI string isolation in Fluent catalogs (`ru.ftl`, `en.ftl`) with runtime language switching without restarting.\n* **Vector-First UI:** Clean vector rendering for widgets, scale indicators, and badges via `ui.painter()` and cached SVGs. Strict prohibition of emoji and rare Unicode characters that cause \"tofu\" boxes (`□`).\n* **Resource Guard:** Compilation and testing strictly throttled (`jobs = 1`, `codegen-units = 1`) to preserve user workstation stability."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793974413995830100",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793974413995830800",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "2. Development Status Matrix"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1793974413995831200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "code": "flowchart TD\n    M1[\"Phase 1: Foundation & Core MVP\"] --> M2[\"Phase 2: Descriptives Engine\"]\n    M2 --> M3[\"Phase 3: Frequencies & Metadata Editor\"]\n    M3 --> M4[\"Phase 4: Reactive Table Editor\"]\n    M4 --> M5[\"Phase 5: Output Viewer Architecture\"]\n    M5 --> M_DOCK[\"Docking & Multi-Document Tabs\"]\n    M_DOCK --> M6[\"Phase 6: Compare Means (t-tests, ANOVA)\"]\n    M6 --> M7[\"Phase 7: Associations (Crosstabs, Correlations)\"]\n    M7 --> M8[\"Phase 8: Data Manipulation (Compute, Recode)\"]\n    M8 --> M9[\"Phase 9: Vector Charts & Brushing\"]\n    M9 --> M10[\"Phase 10: Regression & Multivariate Analytics\"]\n    M10 --> M11[\"Phase 11: SPSS .SAV Codecs & Export\"]\n    M11 --> M12[\"Phase 12: Syntax Editor & AI MCP Bridge\"]\n    M12 --> M13[\"Phase 13: Specialty Modules (Survival, GLM, Mixed, TimeSeries)\"]\n\n    classDef done fill:#2e7d32,stroke:#1b5e20,color:#fff;\n    classDef inprogress fill:#f57c00,stroke:#e65100,color:#fff;\n    classDef planned fill:#37474f,stroke:#263238,color:#fff;\n\n    class M1,M2,M3,M4,M5 done;\n    class M_DOCK inprogress;\n    class M6,M7,M8,M9,M10,M11,M12,M13 planned;",
        "language": "mermaid"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_code_1793974413995833600",
