      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "4.15. \"Help\" Menu Architecture — Educational Center & Open Science"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1793974413995882100",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "Statistical pedagogy, transparent algorithmic specifications, and onboard sample libraries:\n* **Statistics Coach & AI Guide...:** Interactive decision tree guiding researchers to appropriate statistical tests based on scale types, sample dimensions, and normality assumptions, offering direct modal launch;\n* **Mathematical & Algorithm Reference...:** Transparent documentation of the statistical formulas implemented in the L2 `statcraft_algo` core, cross-referenced with peer-reviewed literature and SciPy benchmarks;\n* **Syntax Reference...:** Language specification and syntax grammar guide for `.sps` script automation;\n* **Built-in Sample Datasets ▶:** Single-click onboarding datasets:\n  * Fisher's Iris Dataset (*iris.csv*);\n  * Blood Pressure Clinical Trial (*bp_trial.csv*);\n  * Customer Satisfaction Survey (*survey.csv*);\n* **Check for Updates...:** Notification and release verification service;\n* **About StatCraft...:** Application version, dual MIT / Apache-2.0 licensing, repository links, memory safety audit status (100% Safe Rust), and authorship credits."
      },
